  "body": "Pointer Lock is disabled in sandboxed iframes by default with an [allow-pointer-lock opt-out](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#attr-iframe-sandbox-allow-pointer-lock).  To reduce the potential for abuse / annoyance PointerEvents [setPointerCapture](https://w3c.github.io/pointerevents/#dom-element-setpointercapture) should behave similarly (see https://github.com/w3c/pointerevents/issues/16).\r\n\r\nI propose we add an `allow-pointer-capture` that behaves analogously to `allow-pointer-lock`.  Thoughts?",
